WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:03,660
My family is so poor, but I still have the nerve to come learn acting.

2
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:05,660
Don’t you know that art majors are the most expensive?

3
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:07,660
Do you know how expensive my dance costume is?

4
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:09,660
Now that it's dirty, you'll just cry

5
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:15,960
Sorry, I really didn't know I would come to visit today

6
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:17,960
I will pay you back by working part-time

7
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:21,960
It’s the roommate who comes from a poor family and has an introverted personality.

8
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,960
How much does she want to compensate you? I'll pay it for her.

9
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:24,960
Classmate Song

10
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:29,390
Isn’t this Song Xiaohua, who is very popular recently?

11
00:00:29,390 --> 00:00:31,390
Do you like being the protagonist so much?

12
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:33,390
I have no business listening to your nonsense

13
00:00:33,390 --> 00:00:34,390
I'll compensate for her

14
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:36,390
Just tell me how much it costs

15
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:37,390
My dance costume is custom-made

16
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:39,390
Sixteen thousand, I'll pay.

17
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:42,510
The money was transferred

18
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:44,510
can you go

19
00:00:44,510 --> 00:00:50,740
Okay, it's okay

20
00:00:50,740 --> 00:00:51,740
thank you

21
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:52,740
Thank you very much, Mr. Song

22
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:54,740
They say that about you on the school forum

23
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:56,740
But you are obviously such a good person

24
00:00:56,740 --> 00:00:57,740
The more people you have, the more you will not lose.

25
00:00:57,740 --> 00:00:58,740
Falling into someone else's game

26
00:00:58,740 --> 00:01:00,740
We don't care what they think

27
00:01:00,740 --> 00:01:02,740
Just be yourself

28
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:03,740
i believe you

29
00:01:03,740 --> 00:01:05,740
I feel like people in this profession have problems in their hearts.

30
00:01:05,740 --> 00:01:07,740
It’s also because my family conditions are not good.

31
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:10,740
It’s true that everyone hates me for no reason.

32
00:01:10,740 --> 00:01:12,740
Most people have a serious mentality

33
00:01:12,740 --> 00:01:14,740
We don't care what they think

34
00:01:14,740 --> 00:01:16,740
Just be yourself

35
00:01:16,740 --> 00:01:19,740
Maybe if you didn't hate me

36
00:01:19,740 --> 00:01:21,740
We can try to be friends in the future
